| A. Regional workshop | Cheap and ample | Open | Contract fermentation; functional aquafeed and food ingredients |
| B. Comfortable price-taker | Cheap and ample | Chinese price dominance | Little beyond local niches; efficiency |
| C. Security build-out | Dear and unreliable | Open | Residue-based feed protein; protein from power in the 2040s |
| D. Squeezed importer | Dear and unreliable | Chinese price dominance | Efficiency; non-traded local feeds |

